WEBVTT

00:06:30.267 --> 00:06:33.659
Parents, I'm speaking to you.

00:06:33.683 --> 00:06:38.576
Our generation is determining
the lives of our children.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:42.826
We have 10 years where
we can still make a difference.

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:46.100
We have 10 years
to cut our emissions by half.

00:06:47.183 --> 00:06:49.909
The way to truly love our children

00:06:49.933 --> 00:06:53.142
is to make our actions reflect our words.

00:06:54.058 --> 00:06:57.451
Now it's time to get to work.

00:06:57.475 --> 00:06:58.892
Thank you.